WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.330
Hello, the Internet.

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:02.163
I'm Gav.

00:00:02.163 --> 00:00:04.130
Welcome to this Slow Mo Guys video.

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:05.750
You'll have to pardon my appearance,

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.360
my barber is closed.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:08.980
How inconsiderate of him.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:10.750
This video is slightly different

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:13.720
because my co-star is Smee the cat.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:16.260
He is a six-year-old Siamese,

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:17.650
and he may look slightly tired

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.220
because he spent the entire day

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:23.390
pelting it about the garden
like an absolute lunatic.

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:24.940
Why don't we take a look

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:27.438
at some lovely slow mo footage of that?

00:02:34.015 --> 00:02:36.460
You did so well, boy.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:38.010
You were absolutely leggin' it.

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:42.100
Bit clumsy, though, he does
land on his back an awful lot.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:44.760
You're supposed to land
on your feet, Smee.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:47.123
It's one of the few things
you're supposed to do.

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:50.320
I, honestly makes me wish that

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:52.000
I had this wicked high-speed camera set-up

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.070
when he was a kitten,
because he was a very cute,

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:55.810
and very clumsy kitten.

00:02:55.810 --> 00:02:58.263
I could've filmed a
bunch of that in slow mo.

00:02:59.611 --> 00:03:00.810
Oh wait,

00:03:00.810 --> 00:03:01.643
I did.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:13.910
This is Smee.

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:17.903
His favorite camera is the Phantom Flex.

00:03:18.743 --> 00:03:20.743
As you can see, I'm filming him drinking

00:03:21.801 --> 00:03:24.792
a little bit of water, aren't I, Smee?

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:07.340
Well, there you have it, Slow Mo Cat.

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.520
Unbeatable, internet.

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:09.800
In my opinion.

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:12.080
Big thanks to Smee, the cat,

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:14.910
who is suitably exhausted.

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.510
And big thanks to Turney,

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:19.500
who helped me run around
the garden like a lunatic.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.300
Hopefully, you enjoyed that video.

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:22.710
Make sure you subscribe,

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:23.860
and we'll see you in the next one.

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:26.173
Who knows what that one will be about.

